<%#
  The page-header state pill: the same vocabulary as shared/_status_badge,
  solid. One helper call — a `.tse` cannot import, so the TypeScript app
  copies the expression; ERB reaches the helper. `label`, when given,
  replaces the text and never the class: the story page's "blocked on deps".
%>
<% shown = status_word(status) %>
<span class="state s-<%= shown %>"><%= local_assigns[:label] || shown %></span>
